# LICENSE

This Biwa example project `example` contains various forms of products like:
- Source code
- Asset files
  - Images (Illustrations)
  - Audio
    - Character voice sounds
    - Background music (BGM)
and each of them is subject to a different license and has different rights holders (see below for details).


